  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845861,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## James Bond 007: Everything or Nothing (Game Boy Advance)\n\nExperience the world of espionage on the go with *James Bond 007: Everything or Nothing* for the Game Boy Advance! This handheld adaptation of the popular console title puts you in the iconic shoes of James Bond, voiced and modeled after Pierce Brosnan, as he confronts a new threat involving nanotechnology and terrorism. \n\nContinuing the storyline of *Die Another Day*, Bond travels across continents, engaging in thrilling third-person shooter action. Utilize Bond's signature gadgets and combat skills to overcome enemies and unravel a dangerous plot. While the GBA version captures the essence of the console experience, it offers a streamlined and portable Bond adventure. \n\nFeatures include familiar characters like Q and M, alongside new faces. Though details on the GBA version’s specific gameplay and content differ from the console releases, expect classic Bond thrills and espionage action, perfect for on-the-go gaming."
    },
